The sortable head cell of Table in src/components.rs (a head click sorts by its column, again reverses it, each column
compared by its own type) follows the ideas of rust-ui's DataGrid (https://github.com/rust-ui/ui,
commit 4f5a516e76d75a15a587ab2169352cf34fd318d0: public/docs/components/data-grid.md, PinnableSortableHeaderCell and
SortableColumn), licensed MIT, whose notice follows.

Kbd and KbdGroup in src/components.rs and their looks in src/components.css take their ideas from rust-ui's Kbd (same
commit: app_crates/registry/src/ui/kbd.rs), licensed MIT, under the same notice.

Image, Attachment and AttachmentGroup in src/components.rs and their looks in src/components.css take their ideas from
rust-ui's Image and Attachment (same commit: app_crates/registry/src/ui/{image,attachment}.rs), licensed MIT, under the same
notice.

BottomNav, BottomNavItem and BottomNavMore in src/components.rs and their looks in src/components.css take their ideas from
rust-ui's BottomNav (same commit: app_crates/registry/src/ui/bottom_nav.rs), licensed MIT, under the same notice.

